  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging Microfinance Institutions  to scale up Affordable Housing for the Economically Weaker Section.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Engaging Microfinance Institutions  to scale up Affordable Housing for the Economically Weaker Section.  is a component of Financing Liveable Habitat for Poor in Low Income States reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;477,487. It works in the following sector(s): Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Housing policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
